l=A.mv("According to a study called 10 Common Millionaire Habits by Tom Corley, every millionaire has a common habit of planning ahead. 81% of the 233 millionaires studied keep a to-do list for every activity they do on a day. While 24% keep a to-don\u2019t list to keep the focus on things that matter the most (Corley, 2022). Anyone can start their journey to being a better version of themselves by making this habit their own. It is easy to start with Motion, a free, quick, and efficient project management application. Motion is well suited for personal projects whether it is a day-to-day self-improvement project or a semester-long development project.\nMotion is a Project Management application that allows users to efficiently manage their projects. Some of its features include helping users keep track, create, update, and delete projects in a simple manner. Another special feature that motion has is the ability to filter available projects whether they are ongoing, completed, or overdue.","images/motion/logo.png","Motion",A.c(["images/motion/login.png","images/motion/home_page.png","images/motion/create.png","images/motion/create_page.png","images/motion/view_all.png","images/motion/progress.png"],i),l,"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ly4V789zyp32_qYswL9jOo4FF8htwVL4/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104940817139183600717&rtpof=true&sd=true")
